{"obsah":"<p>Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček was invited to the show Lvíčata on Czech Television, which this year presents various disciplines through short coaching series with personalities from each sport.</p>\n\n<p>To give the coaching a bit of style, they chose the almost cult Nupaky barn, where riders have trained for over 10 years in modest and unconventional conditions. The hall is primarily intended for higher-level riders and isn't very big, but it was enough for filming.</p>\n\n<p>There was some riding too, so hopefully besides the boring theory Vlasta will entertain the boys and girls with his riding over obstacles.</p>\n\n<p>You can find the first episode here: <a href=\"https://decko.ceskatelevize.cz/lvicata\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://decko.ceskatelevize.cz/lvicata</a> (22), and two more episodes will follow.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-02-24-v-11.06.27.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-02-24-v-11.06.27.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202003\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-02-24-v-11.05.53.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-02-24-v-11.05.53.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202002\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-02-24-v-11.05.23.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-02-24-v-11.05.23.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202000\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-02-24-v-11.05.17.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-02-24-v-11.05.17.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202001\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>"}